[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3241.27, "timestamp": "00:54:01", "text": "地方是如何運作的，你知道嗎？我大概能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3243.75, "timestamp": "00:54:03", "text": "明白原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3256.309, "timestamp": "00:54:16", "text": "我覺得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3258.069, "timestamp": "00:54:18", "text": "他們辦了一場非常調皮搗蛋的派對"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3260.39, "timestamp": "00:54:20", "text": "。迪克認為她今後採取的任何行動都是正確的。  記憶力"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3261.245, "timestamp": "00:54:21", "author": "@KripalNishad-ze8rb", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nINduFEoqdR9Ur9aH5Wjyys_h6Cvr5JLOUK2d9YuckXV4H-eJ2TUNvqVabpPDyQcaEZw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "❤"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3264.309, "timestamp": "00:54:24", "text": "真好。打鉤。哦"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3264.454, "timestamp": "00:54:24", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! Kripal Nishad~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3276.87, "timestamp": "00:54:36", "text": "，是的。  那肯定又是一隻死掉的史萊姆，對吧？  又一個死掉的史萊姆。  溢出。  老兄，別再吃史萊姆了。我的天，他們吃完了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3283.43, "timestamp": "00:54:43", "text": "。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3289.99, "timestamp": "00:54:49", "text": "，不再是最後了。  他們又吃了一隻。  什麼？霍布爾斯幾乎什麼都吃。  是啊，那傢伙就看著書。鈷到底吃什麼？為什麼要什麼都吃？  Ariana會"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3292.069, "timestamp": "00:54:52", "text": "走到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3298.309, "timestamp": "00:54:58", "text": "這個面前，然後說她要…她要…她要環顧四周，確保Van沒看見，然後她會把她的"}]